# Livewire

- Place components under `app/Livewire/` (feature subfolders OK)
- Type public properties; never expose secrets or sensitive models as public state
- Authorize inside actions (`$this->authorize()` / policies), not only in the view
- Debounce/throttle expensive `wire:model` inputs
- Do not duplicate Service/Action business logic inside components
- No raw SQL or `DB::` in Livewire — call Service or repository via DI
- Load relations in the component/class; never query Eloquent from Blade
- Keep views presentation-only; avoid large `@php` blocks
